[0:00:00.016] info   liveInspector is set: drop commands into aowlspt-inspect.txt beside this DLL and every save with changed content runs them ON UNITY'S MAIN THREAD, with answers in aowlspt-inspect-out.txt and in this log -- no rebuild, no restart. Start with `help` and `anchors`. Every hop is VirtualQuery-guarded, every command runs under its own VEH guard, and a caught fault reports THE LAST HOP ATTEMPTED and its pointer. Reads only unless liveInspectorWrite is also set. liveInspectorWrite IS set: a batch containing `allow write` may store into live managed objects and CALL game code.
